{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50833","headline":"朱砂石 · 缪岛云","name":"朱砂石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒岩万丈陟崔嵬，只恐朱砂势便颓。\n采蘩客闻雷擘去，卧云僧见鸟衔来。\n丹霞迥烁嵌空片，红日斜分突兀堆。\n傥得神僊惠纤粟，便能轻举向瑶台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}